conx-cpm:LumpSum a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-contract/pricing-model> ; skos:prefLabel "Lump Sum"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Pauschalpreis"@de .
conx-cpm:UnitPrice a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-contract/pricing-model> ; skos:prefLabel "Unit Price"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Einheitspreis"@de .
conx-cpm:HourlyRate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-contract/pricing-model> ; skos:prefLabel "Hourly / Daily Rate"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Stunden- / Tagessatz"@de .
